{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find an object, grab it, move to destination, process, check properties, drop or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
